        "suspected_failure_mechanism": "Switching only the gender bit leaves every first-layer preactivation unchanged. The downstream classifier therefore has to give a neuter singular indefinite phrase the same BASE prediction as its uter counterpart, even when the adjective class calls for a strong neuter.",
